 "decision_for_the_implementer": "Text that preceded the bad block in the same turn stays in content ahead of it; one bad block ends tool parsing for the turn (later blocks are text too). If you prefer a different visible text (for example the whole raw block with its framing), say so in the hand-in; the harness only needs finish_reason 'stop', HTTP 200 and no error frame."
